(self.webpackChunksite=self.webpackChunksite||[]).push([[1555],{9992:e=>{"use strict";e.exports=JSON.parse('{"slug":"uem-breakout","title":"UEM Breakout","authors":[{"name":"Jean Massumi Tamura Aoyagui","contact":"Jean-Massumi","contactType":"github","contactUrl":"https://github.com/Jean-Massumi"}],"date":1752451200000,"readme":"<p>A clone of the classic Breakout game, developed in C for the fantasy console <a href=\\"https://wasm4.org\\">WASM-4</a>. \ud83d\udd79\ufe0f</p>\\n<p>The game recreates the timeless arcade experience where the player controls a paddle to hit a ball and break rows of blocks. It features a dynamic ball that reacts to paddle movement and multiple game states, such as menu, game, game over, and victory screen.</p>\\n<h2>Features</h2>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>Controllable Paddle</strong>: Use the arrow keys to move the paddle at the bottom of the screen.</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>Ball Physics</strong>: The ball bounces off the walls and the paddle. The angle of reflection on the paddle is influenced by the impact location and paddle movement.</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>Destructible Blocks</strong>: A wall of blocks with different colors, each worth a specific score.</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>Game States</strong>: The game has a main menu, game screen, \\"Game Over\\" screen, and \\"Victory\\" screen.</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>Collision Detection</strong>: Precise collision logic between the ball, blocks, paddle, and walls.</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n<h2>Controls</h2>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>Left/Right Arrows</strong>: Move the paddle.</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>X Button</strong>: Starts the game in the menu, launches the ball, and restarts the game after \\"Game Over\\" or \\"Victory\\".</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>Z Button</strong>: Returns to the main menu during the game.</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n<h2>How to Play</h2>\\n<ol>\\n<li>\\n<p>On the menu screen, press <strong>X</strong> to start.</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>Use the <strong>directional arrows</strong> to move the paddle.</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>Press <strong>X</strong> to launch the ball.</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>Hit the ball to break the colored blocks at the top.</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>Don\'t let the ball pass your paddle.</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>The game ends when all blocks are destroyed (victory) or when the ball falls (game over).</p>\\n</li>\\n</ol>\\n<h2>Compiling</h2>\\n<p>To compile the cartridge, run:</p>\\n<pre><code class=\\"language-shell\\">make\\n</code></pre>\\n<p>Then to run:</p>\\n<pre><code class=\\"language-shell\\">w4 run build/UEM-breakout_game.wasm\\n</code></pre>"}')}}]);